<title>JAPAN: MOF says to hold 10-year bond auction Wednesday.</title>
<headline>MOF says to hold 10-year bond auction Wednesday.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Ministry of Finance (MOF) said it plans to hold an auction of 10-year bonds on Wednesday, a MOF official said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Market sources said the volume of the offer is likely to be one trillion yen and that the coupon rate is likely to be set at 2.5 percent.</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Treasury Desk +81-3-3432-8806</p>
